WEBVTT

00:00:01.810 --> 00:00:07.100
<i>Block! Receive! Toss! Attack!</i>

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:16.080
<i>Are you okay?</i>

00:00:18.650 --> 00:00:19.580
Thanks...

00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:25.850
You're not hurt, right?

00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:30.330
I'm good, really! I'm totally...

00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:32.790
..."alright"?

00:00:33.570 --> 00:00:34.560
<i>Good.</i>

00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:39.470
<i>Bye!</i>

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:42.010
<i>Bye!</i>

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:47.270
The heck...?

00:00:51.950 --> 00:00:53.520
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:55.380
Smile Precure!

00:00:55.650 --> 00:00:56.250
Let's go!

00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:57.790
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:00:57.790 --> 00:00:58.920
All together!

00:00:59.150 --> 00:01:00.520
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:02.720
Jump to tomorrow!

00:01:02.890 --> 00:01:05.390
Smile Precure!

00:01:07.260 --> 00:01:10.230
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:15.670
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:20.880
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:01:21.610 --> 00:01:26.820
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:01:27.180 --> 00:01:31.750
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:01:31.150 --> 00:01:31.720
So bright!

00:01:31.750 --> 00:01:36.930
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:01:37.290 --> 00:01:43.370
When you five lights seize the will to win.

00:01:41.330 --> 00:01:43.870
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:45.030
Let's go!

00:01:45.030 --> 00:01:47.740
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:50.670
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:55.480
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:56.040
Girls! Let's go!

00:01:56.110 --> 00:01:57.710
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:57.710 --> 00:01:58.850
Everybody!

00:01:58.880 --> 00:02:00.520
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:03.050
Fly to the future!

00:02:03.390 --> 00:02:06.550
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:02:07.320 --> 00:02:08.720
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:11.030
Smile Precure!

00:02:23.710 --> 00:02:25.860
Hey! You're Alright!

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:28.160
Miss Hino-san?

00:02:29.090 --> 00:02:30.160
<i>Oh!</i>

00:02:39.290 --> 00:02:44.430
So, everyone, this is Brian, who's come here all the way from merry old England.

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:47.920
He'll be a part of our class for the next three weeks.

00:02:47.920 --> 00:02:50.040
It's nice to meet you.

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:54.470
Would you mind showing Brian around after school, Hino-san?

00:02:54.470 --> 00:02:56.030
Better to have someone he knows do the honors.

00:02:59.670 --> 00:03:05.380
Sorry! But I promised Yayoi-chan I'd marathon the Robotter DVD collection with her...

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:06.620
Seriously?!

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:08.680
And we have our clubs to attend!

00:03:09.050 --> 00:03:13.480
Now what am I gonna do?! You know I ain't any good at English!

00:03:13.480 --> 00:03:15.210
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:03:15.460 --> 00:03:17.990
<i>By the way, what's your name?</i>

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:21.560
Sorry! I meant, what's your name?

00:03:21.980 --> 00:03:24.630
<i>My name is Akane!</i>

00:03:24.630 --> 00:03:26.770
I'm pleased to meet you, Akane!

00:03:29.740 --> 00:03:31.070
Same ta you...

00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:34.040
This is the music room.

00:03:34.410 --> 00:03:36.340
Uh, the <i>music room.</i>

00:03:36.340 --> 00:03:38.550
The, uh. <i>book room.</i>

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:42.020
Umm... the <i>sciencey room.</i>

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:46.650
Not sure I'm explainin' this right...

00:03:47.140 --> 00:03:47.910
Akane?

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:49.160
W-What?

00:03:49.350 --> 00:03:50.380
That's a door.

00:03:53.140 --> 00:03:54.050
After you.

00:03:54.790 --> 00:03:57.090
I can open it myself, ya know.

00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:58.600
<i>Ladies first.</i>

00:03:58.600 --> 00:04:02.250
Lady? Not really sure ya can call me that...

00:04:02.250 --> 00:04:05.870
Akane: girl. Akane: lady!

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:12.910
I don't even... ah, forget it. Ain't there anything you'd actually wanna see?

00:04:12.910 --> 00:04:16.850
Oh! Sword fights! Kimonos! Samurais!

00:04:16.850 --> 00:04:18.450
We ain't in a period drama here!

00:04:18.450 --> 00:04:22.560
Aww man... guess I'll have ta teach you the <i>real</i> Japan!

00:04:24.090 --> 00:04:25.890
<i>Wow!</i> Sword fights!

00:04:25.890 --> 00:04:27.780
<i>No!</i> This is kendo!

00:04:27.780 --> 00:04:28.930
Kendo?

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:31.210
Kimonos!

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:32.630
A tea ceremony.

00:04:34.570 --> 00:04:35.840
<i>Ninja girl!</i>

00:04:35.840 --> 00:04:37.170
Archery.

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:39.850
<i>Cool!</i>

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:44.680
Man, it's gettin' late...

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:45.750
Akane!

00:04:48.420 --> 00:04:50.650
Who left <i>that</i> lyin' around?

00:04:54.120 --> 00:04:56.020
Nice, Akane!

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:58.350
Well, yeah! I am in the volleyball club!

00:04:59.390 --> 00:05:02.420
You like volleyball too, huh?

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:04.100
<i>Volleyball!</i>

00:05:05.510 --> 00:05:06.960
<i>Volleyball!</i>

00:05:08.060 --> 00:05:09.480
Volleyball?

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:11.530
<i>Volleyball.</i>

00:05:12.930 --> 00:05:14.110
<i>Volleyball?</i>

00:05:17.280 --> 00:05:18.350
<i>Volleyball.</i>

00:05:18.550 --> 00:05:19.680
<i>Good!</i>

00:05:20.690 --> 00:05:23.400
Hey, Brian! You wanna come watch me at the volleyball club tomorrow?

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:26.090
Uh, I mean... <i>volleyball club.</i>

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:27.760
<i>Ok, sure!</i>

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:28.670
Great!

00:05:31.620 --> 00:05:34.500
He's really been fitting in with the volleyball club, ya know?

00:05:34.730 --> 00:05:37.680
Been takin' part in our practices and everything.

00:05:37.680 --> 00:05:41.150
You're really enjoying being his guide, aren't you, Akane?

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:43.300
Are you coping with the language barrier okay?

00:05:43.300 --> 00:05:47.210
Mmm... we're managing better than I thought.

00:05:47.210 --> 00:05:50.810
Talkin' English with Brian's easier than doin' a te—

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:52.680
Wh... What?

00:05:52.680 --> 00:05:57.080
You know, Akane-chan... Brian's the only thing you seem to talk about nowadays.

00:05:57.080 --> 00:06:01.230
Huh. Ya think? I didn't really notice...

00:06:02.020 --> 00:06:05.030
So, umm, Akane-chan... do you... <i>you know</i>...?

00:06:05.860 --> 00:06:06.780
What?

00:06:07.830 --> 00:06:10.030
Do you... "like" Brian?

00:06:14.800 --> 00:06:16.030
Well, do you?!

00:06:16.030 --> 00:06:18.150
I dunno! I ain't thought about it!

00:06:18.150 --> 00:06:21.810
It's easy to tell, Akane! Is your heart all aflutter when you're with him?!

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:24.650
A-Aflutter?! I... well...

00:06:25.510 --> 00:06:27.250
Akane: lady!

00:06:29.220 --> 00:06:31.390
It is!

00:06:31.390 --> 00:06:33.750
You're in love! I knew it!

00:06:33.750 --> 00:06:35.620
Ain't we gettin' ahead of our—

00:06:35.630 --> 00:06:37.060
Oh my, Akane-san.

00:06:37.060 --> 00:06:37.540
Come on!

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:38.920
We've been so blind!

00:06:38.920 --> 00:06:39.420
Guys, seriously!

00:06:39.420 --> 00:06:40.210
Akane-chan!

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:40.900
What?!

00:06:40.900 --> 00:06:43.100
You have to tell him!

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:45.560
T-Tell him? Are you sayin'...?

00:06:45.560 --> 00:06:48.170
Of course we are! You have to confess!

00:06:50.540 --> 00:06:52.570
We will now engage Operation Cinderella!

00:06:52.790 --> 00:06:56.460
Your brave knight will return your shoe to you, and you'll live happily ever after!

00:06:56.460 --> 00:06:57.250
Here he comes!

00:06:57.250 --> 00:06:58.350
Go!

00:06:58.350 --> 00:06:59.450
We're doin' this for real?!

00:07:00.550 --> 00:07:01.600
Brian!

00:07:02.420 --> 00:07:03.220
<i>Here.</i>

00:07:03.820 --> 00:07:04.670
Thanks!

00:07:04.670 --> 00:07:06.000
<i>You're welcome!</i>

00:07:07.380 --> 00:07:08.300
That's it?

00:07:08.300 --> 00:07:10.790
It was meant to be more dashing!

00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:15.200
You can't use cheap tricks for this kinda thing! Lemme show you how it's done.

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:17.340
Y-You've just gotta say it to his face!

00:07:17.340 --> 00:07:18.700
O-Okay...

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:21.970
I... I lo... I lo...

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:25.840
Damn it, I can't do this!

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:27.850
I can't! I'm not ready!

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:27.850
Don't be a wuss!

00:07:27.850 --> 00:07:29.640
Somethin's wrong here...

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:32.410
If you can't tell him outright, then draw him a picture!

00:07:32.410 --> 00:07:34.250
A picture, <i>seriously?</i>

00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:35.150
Are you done?

00:07:36.480 --> 00:07:38.510
Akane? No.

00:07:38.510 --> 00:07:39.650
I know...

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:42.420
If art fails you, why not write a letter?

00:07:42.760 --> 00:07:46.360
A blank canvas, which you may cover with all the thoughts that flood your heart!

00:07:46.380 --> 00:07:47.850
A love letter?!

00:07:47.850 --> 00:07:52.870
Go on! Go on, go on!

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:52.870
I can't with you guys here!

00:07:55.230 --> 00:07:57.240
Man, I'm beat...

00:07:57.240 --> 00:07:59.310
Huh? Brian?

00:07:59.880 --> 00:08:01.580
You're in love!

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:06.050
This whole thing's ridiculous!

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:07.520
What're you doin' there?

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:11.720
Akane! I'm looking for a shop that sells delicious Japanese food.

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:13.160
Leave it ta me!

00:08:13.420 --> 00:08:17.430
<i>Delicious! This is okonomiyaki!</i>

00:08:19.350 --> 00:08:20.670
<i>Brilliant!</i>

00:08:21.360 --> 00:08:22.860
Akane, you're the best!

00:08:22.860 --> 00:08:24.600
Aww, ya flatter me.

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:27.920
Whoa, Akane! You've caught yourself a hunk there!

00:08:27.920 --> 00:08:30.100
He ain't my boyfriend!

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:31.410
Thanks for the food, anyway!

00:08:31.410 --> 00:08:33.490
Yeah, cheers.

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:34.660
"Cheers"?

00:08:35.350 --> 00:08:38.580
Oh, right. Kind of a slang, Osakan way of saying thanks.

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:41.320
Osakan? That's the way you talk!

00:08:41.320 --> 00:08:44.120
Yup. I guess you'd say "<i>Thank you</i>".

00:08:44.130 --> 00:08:45.030
<i>Thank you!</i>

00:08:45.030 --> 00:08:45.830
<i>Thank you.</i>

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:46.790
Cheers!

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:47.730
<i>Yes!</i>

00:08:48.260 --> 00:08:51.160
Cheers... Okonomiyaki...

00:08:52.060 --> 00:08:56.800
You've taught me a lot about Japan, Akane. I'm so happy.

00:08:56.800 --> 00:09:03.700
Can you teach me more... about your country, and your language?

00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:07.240
Sure thing! Leave it to me!

00:09:07.240 --> 00:09:08.520
<i>Oh!</i>

00:09:09.580 --> 00:09:10.040
{TLC: with apologies to the Japanese production staff here, the irony in this book title is delicious.}

00:09:44.870 --> 00:09:49.210
I reckon this is the best view of the city you're gonna get.

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:51.250
<i>It's beautiful...</i>

00:09:52.350 --> 00:09:53.360
Ain't it?

00:09:53.790 --> 00:09:54.590
Akane...

00:09:54.590 --> 00:09:55.540
Yeah?

00:09:55.540 --> 00:09:58.270
I'm so glad I came to Japan.

00:09:58.770 --> 00:10:02.460
You've taught me so much, Akane...

00:10:02.930 --> 00:10:07.370
Every day is very fun, but...

00:10:11.070 --> 00:10:13.910
the time has come... for me to go home...

00:10:16.320 --> 00:10:17.400
Oh...

00:10:18.530 --> 00:10:21.750
I guess it has been three weeks, huh...

00:10:21.750 --> 00:10:22.550
Yes.

00:10:23.320 --> 00:10:25.750
I should really be heading back...

00:10:26.960 --> 00:10:29.320
I'll see you tomorrow, Akane!

00:10:31.970 --> 00:10:36.590
I forgot... he was gonna have to go back home...

00:10:42.450 --> 00:10:46.370
I thought you told me you loved me! Was that all a lie?

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:47.610
Goodbye.

00:10:47.860 --> 00:10:49.580
At least hear me out!

00:10:48.450 --> 00:10:51.440
Love? Bah! Who needs it?

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:51.480
There's nothing you can say.

00:10:51.440 --> 00:10:52.470
Please, don't leave me!

00:10:57.410 --> 00:10:58.490
Sunny!

00:11:04.290 --> 00:11:05.410
Candy!

00:11:08.320 --> 00:11:12.270
I guess this is goodbye. Thank you for everything!

00:11:12.850 --> 00:11:14.540
Safe travels!

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:16.360
Come visit us again sometime!

00:11:16.740 --> 00:11:19.090
I'll make sure to write!

00:11:23.180 --> 00:11:24.840
Bye bye, Brian!

00:11:24.850 --> 00:11:26.180
Take care!

00:11:26.180 --> 00:11:28.080
So now he's gone...

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:29.950
Say, where is Akane-san?

00:11:29.950 --> 00:11:32.350
Maybe she went to see him off at the airport.

00:11:32.930 --> 00:11:36.580
Hey, don't you guys think Akane-chan was acting weird today?

00:11:42.400 --> 00:11:43.530
Akane!

00:11:43.530 --> 00:11:45.680
I thought you went with him to the airport!

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:48.100
Nah... why would I do that?

00:11:48.120 --> 00:11:51.150
But you haven't even told him how you feel yet!

00:11:51.150 --> 00:11:54.880
Cause I don't feel anything, alright?!

00:11:54.880 --> 00:12:00.110
We just had a lot of fun together, that's all...

00:12:00.380 --> 00:12:01.620
Then at least—!

00:12:01.620 --> 00:12:02.680
Give me a break!

00:12:04.290 --> 00:12:10.140
I mean, it's not like I'm ever gonna see him again...

00:12:11.990 --> 00:12:13.770
And that's fine with you?!

00:12:16.300 --> 00:12:20.070
I'm not sure what to say...

00:12:21.200 --> 00:12:23.170
This just isn't like you, Akane-chan!

00:12:29.070 --> 00:12:30.460
Sorry I'm late!

00:12:30.440 --> 00:12:31.710
Not a problem!

00:12:31.710 --> 00:12:34.350
Oh! You're wearing that pendant!

00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:35.350
Of course!

00:12:35.350 --> 00:12:38.820
"Sorry I'm late!" Really?! Ugh!

00:12:35.820 --> 00:12:37.850
It was a present from <i>you!</i>

00:12:39.190 --> 00:12:41.990
This world will be stained with the worst possible conclusion...

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:44.390
...a Bad End!

00:12:44.390 --> 00:12:47.900
The blank slate of your future will be clouded in darkness!

00:12:50.360 --> 00:12:51.330
Is this...?

00:12:55.800 --> 00:13:03.980
The Bad Energy we gather from these humans will resurrect the Emperor of Darkness, Pierrot-sama!

00:13:07.620 --> 00:13:08.950
Hold it!

00:13:09.950 --> 00:13:11.620
Hurry and transform-kuru!

00:13:15.270 --> 00:13:16.590
Ready?

00:13:16.990 --> 00:13:19.790
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:13:19.790 --> 00:13:20.810
Go!

00:13:21.860 --> 00:13:23.160
Go, go!

00:13:23.620 --> 00:13:25.000
Let's go!

00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:40.490
The light of the future, shining bright!

00:13:41.940 --> 00:13:43.630
Cure Happy!

00:13:46.580 --> 00:13:48.390
Dazzling sun!

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:50.200
Hot-blooded power!

00:13:51.530 --> 00:13:52.970
Cure Sunny!

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:58.480
Rock, paper, scissors! Sparkling bright...

00:14:00.010 --> 00:14:01.630
Cure Peace!

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:07.210
Laying down the gauntlet, with courage blazing!

00:14:08.610 --> 00:14:10.370
Cure March!

00:14:12.880 --> 00:14:16.320
A gentle heart as pure as the driven snow...

00:14:17.550 --> 00:14:19.190
Cure Beauty!

00:14:21.410 --> 00:14:23.890
Our five lights will blaze a path to the future!

00:14:29.960 --> 00:14:34.200
Shining bright, Smile Precure!

00:14:37.180 --> 00:14:40.130
Come out and play, Hyper Akanbe!

00:14:46.450 --> 00:14:49.380
Hyper Akanbe!

00:14:49.840 --> 00:14:51.750
The heck do you think you're doing?!

00:14:52.580 --> 00:14:55.890
Getting rid of all these couples and their lovey-dovey crap!

00:14:58.160 --> 00:14:59.590
You're despicable!

00:15:01.230 --> 00:15:02.560
Hyper!

00:15:02.760 --> 00:15:05.270
Love, romance — it's all garbage!

00:15:05.270 --> 00:15:06.700
No it's not!

00:15:06.700 --> 00:15:09.440
There is nothing more beautiful in life than to give your heart to another!

00:15:12.850 --> 00:15:16.470
How would you know, you immature little runts?!

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:24.950
Blab all you like, but all your "love" is gonna end in a break up!

00:15:25.620 --> 00:15:27.160
What's the point?!

00:15:31.880 --> 00:15:35.530
You waste all that time and effort just to end up alone!

00:15:38.600 --> 00:15:47.340
But... that doesn't make it a waste of time... You've got to be more... positive...

00:15:50.860 --> 00:15:52.450
Hyper!

00:15:52.450 --> 00:15:53.620
She's right!

00:15:55.420 --> 00:15:59.350
It ain't a waste of time, and it ain't a waste of effort!

00:16:01.990 --> 00:16:02.920
Sunny!

00:16:04.890 --> 00:16:06.760
Use the Sports Décor-kuru!

00:16:07.370 --> 00:16:09.980
Let's Go: Sports!

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:12.370
Akanbe!

00:16:14.050 --> 00:16:16.340
Prove it! How is it not a waste?

00:16:16.560 --> 00:16:23.300
I dunno if I can answer that yet, but...

00:16:23.300 --> 00:16:24.480
Akan...

00:16:24.480 --> 00:16:29.370
Even if we can't be together, the moments we shared ain't gonna just disappear!

00:16:33.940 --> 00:16:39.060
And I ain't gonna let you tell me they were a waste of time!

00:16:41.150 --> 00:16:42.090
Hyper!

00:16:42.090 --> 00:16:48.000
Akanbe! Akanbe! Akanbe! Akanbe!

00:16:50.540 --> 00:16:53.040
Akanbe?!

00:16:54.010 --> 00:16:54.770
Now's our chance!

00:16:54.770 --> 00:16:55.580
Right!

00:16:58.930 --> 00:17:02.360
Pegasus, grant us your power!

00:17:07.820 --> 00:17:11.660
Precure: Princess Form!

00:17:17.170 --> 00:17:19.600
Reveal your secrets, Royal Clock!

00:17:20.450 --> 00:17:24.240
Combine our powers together-kuru!

00:17:28.660 --> 00:17:31.610
May the light of hope shine!

00:17:32.280 --> 00:17:35.730
Let it soar to a radiant future!

00:17:37.040 --> 00:17:38.250
Precure...

00:17:38.730 --> 00:17:41.970
Royal Rainbow...

00:17:41.970 --> 00:17:44.600
Burst!

00:17:48.960 --> 00:17:51.990
Akanbe...!

00:17:56.340 --> 00:18:00.020
Shine, Happy smiles!

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:07.820
We got the Star Décor-kuru!

00:18:08.170 --> 00:18:09.380
Damn you!

00:18:14.940 --> 00:18:15.820
Akane-chan!

00:18:15.820 --> 00:18:17.990
Sorry, guys... I've gotta run!

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:26.240
Wait for me, please!

00:18:24.830 --> 00:18:26.240
Wait!

00:18:26.240 --> 00:18:26.900
Nao?!

00:18:27.100 --> 00:18:28.370
We wanna get on!

00:18:30.590 --> 00:18:32.930
I ain't got any money on me, though...

00:18:32.930 --> 00:18:34.830
Akane-san!

00:18:37.410 --> 00:18:38.680
Take this!

00:18:38.680 --> 00:18:39.810
Reika!

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:41.850
I'd rather that you used it.

00:18:44.170 --> 00:18:45.220
Cheers!

00:18:51.960 --> 00:18:53.930
Awww crap, I ain't gonna make it...

00:18:53.930 --> 00:18:56.370
Akane-chan!

00:18:57.170 --> 00:18:59.300
Akane!

00:19:00.270 --> 00:19:01.770
Miyuki! Yayoi!

00:19:01.940 --> 00:19:03.640
Use my bike!

00:19:03.640 --> 00:19:06.510
Here, I drew you a map with some shortcuts!

00:19:08.050 --> 00:19:09.050
Cheers, guys!

00:19:35.590 --> 00:19:36.830
The chain's broken...

00:19:38.550 --> 00:19:40.270
Sorry 'bout this, Miyuki!

00:20:15.500 --> 00:20:18.840
I... I was too late...

00:20:28.560 --> 00:20:29.660
<i>Are you okay?</i>

00:20:34.530 --> 00:20:38.630
Yeah. I'm alright.

00:20:41.410 --> 00:20:42.630
Brian...

00:20:46.370 --> 00:20:48.370
I thought you'd have left already.

00:20:48.380 --> 00:20:50.710
No. I was waiting.

00:20:50.710 --> 00:20:54.280
I knew you'd come to see me off.

00:20:55.350 --> 00:20:57.610
Sorry I'm late, then!

00:20:59.050 --> 00:21:06.450
Hey, Brian... I dunno how to put this, really, but...

00:21:08.580 --> 00:21:09.530
Cheers!

00:21:11.350 --> 00:21:16.890
It was so fun being at school with you... and your okonomiyaki was amazing.

00:21:16.890 --> 00:21:20.890
You taught me so much, about so many things...

00:21:22.460 --> 00:21:25.770
I can't thank you enough, Akane.

00:21:26.120 --> 00:21:32.570
You made me fall so deeply in love with your country...

00:21:33.450 --> 00:21:36.320
So... cheers!

00:21:40.370 --> 00:21:44.680
I... I loved having you around too!

00:21:45.910 --> 00:21:49.470
You helped me out so much, taught me so much English...

00:21:50.720 --> 00:21:53.580
So it should be me, Brian, saying...

00:21:55.900 --> 00:21:57.130
<i>Thank you.</i>

00:23:39.300 --> 00:23:40.890
It's time to elect the student council!

00:23:40.890 --> 00:23:43.770
Hold it! We're putting our names in too!

00:23:43.770 --> 00:23:44.530
Who are you?

00:23:44.530 --> 00:23:47.260
If I'm president, I'll ban homework!

00:23:47.260 --> 00:23:48.780
Video games will be on the curriculum!

00:23:48.780 --> 00:23:50.330
And you can eat all the sweets you want!

00:23:50.590 --> 00:23:51.370
I'm in!

00:23:51.940 --> 00:23:54.570
Not so fast! Your plan would lead to our ruin!

00:23:54.570 --> 00:23:56.670
I shall show you the correct path!

00:23:57.570 --> 00:23:59.280
Smile Precure:

00:24:02.150 --> 00:24:04.110
Find your ultra happy smile!
